        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/c5a63c328a4ef66288fdcc1bccf99a4e.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1024 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the scientists sent into the noEndHOUSE — a shifting, paranormal structure with no known end. The corporation seeks knowledge, relics, and power hidden within its walls. Your mission is simple: collect samples and extract artifacts.But the house is alive. It watches. And not everyone who enters… returns. Each expedition tests your sanity, your teamwork, and your will to survive. Will you escape the unknown — or become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/17821da8842c58ed4d6f7642badcd856.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/17821da8842c58ed4d6f7642badcd856.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/25eeadde9d9b74380e5fc37fda6ed614.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1024 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >noEndHOUSE is a cooperative horror experience where you and your team descend into twisted, monster-infested environments filled with deadly secrets and challenging puzzles. Teamwork isn’t just recommended — it’s your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there’s a catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, one of you can become <i>infected</i>. Will they confess and search for a cure with the group… or betray everyone and embrace the darkness within?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks will demand sacrifice. Some will demand trust. And not everyone will make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With immersive physics-based gameplay, high replayability, and unpredictable player choices — <strong>noENDHOUSE</strong> blurs the line between cooperation and deception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/50039a071e08c585f36fedc7debf8a7e.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/50039a071e08c585f36fedc7debf8a7e.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/54ddabfdcd99fdb90044284e785b5ebb.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/54ddabfdcd99fdb90044284e785b5ebb.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.mp4?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/ac1f3a74db8f22131b97047a980437c5.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/ac1f3a74db8f22131b97047a980437c5.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/c5a63c328a4ef66288fdcc1bccf99a4e.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1024 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the scientists sent into the noEndHOUSE — a shifting, paranormal structure with no known end. The corporation seeks knowledge, relics, and power hidden within its walls. Your mission is simple: collect samples and extract artifacts.But the house is alive. It watches. And not everyone who enters… returns. Each expedition tests your sanity, your teamwork, and your will to survive. Will you escape the unknown — or become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/17821da8842c58ed4d6f7642badcd856.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/17821da8842c58ed4d6f7642badcd856.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/25eeadde9d9b74380e5fc37fda6ed614.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1024 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >noEndHOUSE is a cooperative horror experience where you and your team descend into twisted, monster-infested environments filled with deadly secrets and challenging puzzles. Teamwork isn’t just recommended — it’s your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there’s a catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, one of you can become <i>infected</i>. Will they confess and search for a cure with the group… or betray everyone and embrace the darkness within?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks will demand sacrifice. Some will demand trust. And not everyone will make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With immersive physics-based gameplay, high replayability, and unpredictable player choices — <strong>noENDHOUSE</strong> blurs the line between cooperation and deception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/50039a071e08c585f36fedc7debf8a7e.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/50039a071e08c585f36fedc7debf8a7e.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/54ddabfdcd99fdb90044284e785b5ebb.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/54ddabfdcd99fdb90044284e785b5ebb.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/1d761f23e52be508e9ff2ccfed1d2b47.mp4?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/ac1f3a74db8f22131b97047a980437c5.poster.avif?t=1786513567\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929240/extras/ac1f3a74db8f22131b97047a980437c5.webm?t=1786513567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
